---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Stepfamily support" description="Stepparent and blended family support in Victoria, BC and across BC with Rachel Glover, RCC.">
<div class="wrap"><section class="pg-hero">
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow rise" style="--d:.1s">Stepparent &amp; stepfamily support</p>
        <h1 class="b-h1"><span class="mask"><span style="--d:.2s">Build the family</span></span><span class="mask acc"><span style="--d:.36s">you’re actually in.</span></span></h1>
        <p class="lede rise" style="--d:.65s">Bringing two households together is hard on everyone in it. I help stepparents, partners and blended families find roles, routines and ways of talking that work for this family.</p>
        <div class="rise" style="--d:.8s;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free 15-minute call <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <svg class="pg-forms" viewBox="0 0 116 80" aria-hidden="true"><g class="l"><circle cx="30" cy="40" r="26" fill="#CDB792"/></g>
        <g class="mid"><circle cx="58" cy="40" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#5C1A26" stroke-width="1.4"/></g>
        <g class="r"><circle cx="86" cy="40" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#655247" stroke-width="1.1"/></g></svg>
    </section></div><section class="band"><div class="wrap split2">
      <div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What comes up</p><h2 class="b-h1 h2">The everyday friction of blending</h2></div>
      <div class="reveal"><ul class="checks stagger"><li>Not knowing where you fit as a stepparent, or how much to parent.</li><li>Feeling caught between your partner and your children.</li><li>Different house rules, discipline styles and expectations.</li><li>Co-parenting with an ex, and the strain it puts on your relationship.</li><li>Kids who are struggling with the change, or pushing back.</li><li>The couple getting lost under everything else.</li></ul></div>
    </div></section><section class="band alt"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="reveal" style="max-width:720px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p class="eyebrow">Who comes to sessions</p><h2 class="b-h1 h2">Start with whoever is ready.</h2></div>
      <div class="b1-cards stagger">
        <div class="b1-card static"><h3>The couple</h3><p>Most stepfamily work starts with the two adults, so you can get on the same page before anything else.</p><span class="meta">Couples rates, from $180</span></div>
        <div class="b1-card static"><h3>A stepparent on their own</h3><p>Space to talk about how it’s really going for you, and what you’d like to change.</p><span class="meta">Individual rate, $140</span></div>
        <div class="b1-card static"><h3>A parent on their own</h3><p>For the parent in the middle, balancing loyalty to their kids and their partner.</p><span class="meta">Individual rate, $140</span></div>
      </div>
    </div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap split2">
      <div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="b-h1 h2">Before you book</h2></div>
      <div class="reveal"><div class="faq reveal"><details><summary>Do you see children or the whole family?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>My work is with adults: couples, stepparents and parents. If your child would benefit from their own support, I can suggest where to look.</p></details><details><summary>My partner and I disagree about the kids. Is that normal?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Very. It’s one of the most common reasons stepfamilies come in, and it’s workable.</p></details><details><summary>In person or online?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Either. 941 Kings Rd in Victoria, or secure video anywhere in BC.</p></details></div></div>
    </div></section><section class="band dark"><div class="wrap b1-close reveal">
      <h2 class="b-h1">Blending takes time. <span>You don’t have to work it out alone.</span></h2>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn light-fill" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free consultation <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="btn ghost" href="/contact#qform">Ask a question</a></div>
    </div></section>
</Base>
